{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝呼召以賽亞"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["烏西雅王駕崩那年，我看見主坐在高高的寶座上，祂的衣袍下垂，充滿聖殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在祂上方侍立著撒拉弗天使，他們各有三對翅膀：一對遮臉，一對遮腳，一對飛翔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他們彼此呼喊：",{"text":"「聖哉，聖哉，聖哉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的榮耀充滿大地。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他們的呼喊聲震動聖殿門檻的基石，聖殿裡煙雲彌漫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那時我說：「我有禍了！我要滅亡了！因為我嘴唇不潔淨，又住在嘴唇不潔淨的民中，並且親眼看見了大君王——萬軍之耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["有個撒拉弗天使用火鉗從祭壇上取了一塊燃燒的炭，飛到我面前，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["用炭碰我的嘴，說：「看啊，這炭碰了你的嘴唇，你的過犯已被除掉，你的罪惡已被赦免。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然後，我聽見主說：「我可以差遣誰呢？誰肯為我們去呢？」我說：「我在這裡，請差遣我！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祂說：「你去告訴這百姓，",{"text":"「『你們聽了又聽，卻不明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看了又看，卻不領悟。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要讓這些人心靈麻木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵發背，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼睛昏花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得他們眼睛看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵聽見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裡明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回心轉意，就得到醫治。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我說：「主啊，這要到什麼時候呢？」祂說：",{"text":"「直到城邑荒涼，無人居住，房屋空置，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"土地荒廢的時候。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我必把他們趕到遠方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的土地必大量荒廢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使境內只剩下十分之一的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必被消滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，就像砍掉松樹和橡樹後必留下樹樁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聖潔的苗裔就是殘留的樹樁。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}